({0:\fm}NAME)[({0:n}NAME):{0:\f}NAME({0:n}NAME)
.EQN 0 16 248 0
({0:\fmn}NAME)[({0:n}NAME):({0:\fm}NAME)[({0:n}NAME)+({0:no}NAME)[({0:n}NAME)
.TXT 5 -47 249 0
Cg a71.000000,73.000000,157
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
}
{\plain {Now that we have our modulated 
signal s(t) plus noise, we use the phase-locked
 loop to demodulate it.  We use a linearized
 equation to define }{\f1 f}{f.}}
}
